{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04067","headline":"寒食宴于中舍别驾兄弟宅 · 苏頲","name":"寒食宴于中舍别驾兄弟宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子推山上歌龙罢，定国门前结驷来。\n始覩元昆锵玉至，旋闻季子佩刀廻。\n晴花处处因风起，御柳条条向日开。\n自有长筵欢不极，还将彩服咏南陔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04067.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04067","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}